  JohnnyStoreItems: []
  shopItems:
  - name: Quarter
    description: "Need to buy something elsewhere? Give your 25 coins to get 25\xA2
      or a shiny quarter!"
    type: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bc741fb589c9cdb7436d094034fb0a83, type: 3}
    itemId: 5
    cost: 25
    Sale: 0
  - name: Mystery Door
    description: Are you mysterious? You won't be for long when you get a mystery
      item from the mysterous door.
    type: 1
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 15524fa86b281cb499023e860211e2e4, type: 3}
    itemId: -1
    cost: 100
    Sale: 0
  - name: BSODA
    description: Love soda? Then you'll love this. This soda is one of the best drinks
      in the world and has a brilliant taste. However, make sure to not spill it.
    type: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7a3e00860448ba884b421697cfc0576d, type: 3}
    itemId: 4
    cost: 100
    Sale: 0
  - name: Apple
    description: If you're hungry, you'll have to eat something. Take an apple!
    type: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 770109467e9d7ea4f86745cbdef2fff6, type: 3}
    itemId: 11
    cost: 200
    Sale: 0
  - name: Energy flavored Zesty Bar
    description: Want a snack? This zesty bar has special flavor that gives you a
      lot of energy.
    type: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 135b4d1063b9c18b477353a9760f2af6, type: 3}
    itemId: 1
    cost: 100
    Sale: 0
  - name: Safety Scissors
    description: You need to cut something? Get these. They'll make it easy to cut
      strings and paper. They'll also safe to take, so don't worry about getting
      hurt!
    type: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b0b75a2e56f1d8a9479c70948e8ceabb, type: 3}
    itemId: 9
    cost: 50
    Sale: 0
  - name: Swinging Door Lock
    description: Don't want anyone know what's on the other side? If you have a yellow
      door, this lock will do the job for a maximum of 15 seconds.
    type: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6c13ee2bef2de5bc44c11d9eea4c1ad6, type: 3}
    itemId: 2
    cost: 250
    Sale: 0
  - name: WD-NoSquee (Door Type)
    description: Doors getting too squeaky? This item will perfectly silent any doors
      when you apply it. Careful, it'll sound squeaky again after opening the door
      4 times.
    type: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7c7dc888fdf075aa470d66cfce14933d, type: 3}
    itemId: 8
    cost: 700
    Sale: 0
  - name: Big Ol' Boots
    description: These old boots don't look like much, but they're sturdy. They can
      withstand movement from anything, so you don't have to worry getting pushed
      around anymore. Be aware they can break in a bit once worn.
    type: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 30a9dfa7f775fdc4da8815a7f1df0903, type: 3}
    itemId: 10
    cost: 175
    Sale: 0
