  ItemDescriptions:
  - Nothing.
  - Want a snack? This zesty bar has special flavor that can give you a lot of energy.
  - Don't want anyone know what's on the other side? If you have a yellow door, this
    lock will do the job for a maximum of 15 seconds.
  - Are you a troublemaker? Get more trouble by using one of these special keys that
    can unlock any office door.
  - Love soda? Then you'll love this. This soda is one of the best drinks in the
    world and has a brilliant taste. However, make sure to not spill it.
  - "Need to buy something elsewhere? Give your 25 coins to get 25\xA2 which is a
    shiny quarter!"
  - Feeling noisy? Get this noisy tape. It can produce a lot of noise where everyone
    near you become deaf.
  - Want a distraction? Get this noisy alarm clock. Once activated, in the next 30
    seconds, this alarm clock will beep very loud where everyone can hear it and
    get distracted.
  - Doors getting too squeaky? This item will perfectly silent any doors when you
    apply it. Careful, it'll sound squeaky again after opening the door 4 times.
  - You need to cut something? Get these. They'll make it easy to cut strings and
    paper. They'll also safe to take, so don't worry about getting hurt!
  - These old boots don't look like much, but they're sturdy. They can withstand
    movement from anything, so you don't have to worry getting pushed around anymore.
    Be aware they can break in a bit once worn.
  - If you're hungry, you'll have to eat something. Take an apple! Good fruit to
    eat with.
  - THIS APPLE IS VERY POWERFUL! USE IT WISELY!
  - 'Need to go somewhere quick? Look no forward to the new invention Teleporter.
    It can get you anywhere when you''re in a hurry. <color=red>CAUTION: Only use
    in a life-threatening situation, not a toy. It will uncontrollably teleport you
    at very high speeds.'
  - Want some money by people opening your yellow door? Just use this lock and it'll
    only let anyone pass if they insert a quarter.
  - 'Need something to write with? Get yourself a pencil. It''s a simple tool to
    write anything you want. <color=red>CAUTION: Not a toy, do not stab anyone with
    a pencil as it can temporarily injure someone.'
  - BLEEDING? Get a free health kit immediately and it'll heal you overtime. Unlimited
    uses.
  - You see a troublemaker? Blow this whistle to call your local principal to your
    location. They'll guarantee arive shortly.
  - Don't want to go to class? With this pass, you will be able to skip one class
    where you won't have to attend. (Suggested by Mr. Heutheer)
  - This has very secret ingredients, and you'll only know what it does when you
    buy it.
  - Want to go to the end of the hallway fast? Use this. It'll stick to a wall and
    pull you towards it safely. Very good transporation item if you need to go somewhere
    or suffer physical pain.
  - IT'S NOT A POSTER! This invention creates a portal on both sides of a wall where
    you can WALK THROUGH it. Crazy? I know right.
  - Need to disguise as a school faculty member? No problem. This nametag makes anyone
    believe that you are a faculty member. However, use it appropriately as it will
    render useless after 30 seconds.
  - Quick! You need to hide! Use this chalk eraser tool. It'll produce clouds around
    you where no one expects you're here. Pretty good tool for Hide & Seek.
  - One of Dr. Reflex's hammers where it can be used to squish anyone in your path.
  - Drop this on the floor and anyone who walks over it will slip around until they
    crash into something! Use it with caution because you can slip with it too!
  coinsText: {fileID: 89261595}
  statusText: {fileID: 873989902}
  TestValue: 0
  updateDelay: 0
  updateTime: 0
