  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<u>Where can I use coins?</u>

    You can use coins in the shop. You''re
    currently on it right now.</size>

    <u>How do I get coins?</u>

    You can
    get coins by completing minigames, field trips, acheivements, and more!

    <u>Why
    there''s different shop items in Johnny''s Store?</u>

    Johnny sells different
    items every-day, where items get added, removed, or even remain in the store.

    <u>Why
    is Johnny''s store out of stock?</u>

    His store relies on your internet connection.
    If he can''t connect to the servers, he won''t be able to sell you anything from
    his store. You can still buy stuff from Baldi, but not from Johnny himself.

    <u>Why
    I have a different amount of coins?</u>

    If you are logged in to BBTUD Community,
    your coins are synced to your account. That means your coins are shared across
    logged-in devices.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d61cd532fe6fc504da7d402cb1e1f9c5, type: 2}
